  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "The goal is to clearly define expectations for your team, challenge them in their roles, and provide them with responsibilities that make the best use of their strengths and abilities.\n\n[Clarifying Performance Expectations](video \"LiL3_Clarifying_Expectations\")\n\n**Watch**: *Clarifying Performance Expectations*\n\n---\n\nThink about how you lead your team and answer these questions:\n\n> Are you crystal clear on each team member's role? Are they?\n\n> What percent of each work day does each team member spend utilizing their strengths?\n\n> How many of your team members are working on projects that challenge them?\n\nConsidering your answers, where could you do a better job managing roles on your team?",
